19140    !                                         quit;


19141      ods path work.templat(update) sashelp.tmplmst(read);
19142      
19143      data survey; do state=1 to 2; do school=1 to 4; do id=1 to 6; response=1+mod(id+school,3); schooltype=1+mod(school,2);
19143    ! samplingweight=2+state+school/10; output; end; end; end; run;

NOTE: The data set WORK.SURVEY has 48 observations and 6 variables.

19144      proc surveyfreq data=survey; strata state; cluster school; weight samplingweight; tables schooltype*response / row chisq; run;

NOTE: The Rao-Scott chi-square test cannot be computed for the table of schooltype by response because the design correction is not positive.
NOTE: The PROCEDURE SURVEYFREQ printed page 1378.

